# Genius Zone Model School – Complete Website Development Master Prompt

Your project should be developed as a **complete School Management System (SMS) + Dynamic School Website**, not just a normal informational website.

I recommend building it in stages so that you can test each feature before moving to the next one. The website will have four main user areas:

1. Public Website – accessible to everyone.
2. Admin Dashboard – complete control of the school website and management.
3. Teacher & Staff Dashboard – academic and administrative activities.
4. Student & Guardian Dashboard – academic progress, attendance, fees, results and applications.

**Recommended technology:** Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Supabase + Vercel + GitHub.

Below is a master prompt you can give to an AI coding assistant to develop the project.

