\# PART 8: SMART QR CODE ATTENDANCE SYSTEM\
\
\## 18. QR-Based Student Attendance\
\
Create an integrated mobile-friendly QR attendance system.\
\
Every student receives a unique QR code.\
\
The QR code should contain a secure student identifier, not sensitive personal information.\
\
\### Scanner Features\
\
Admin, teacher or authorized staff opens the attendance scanner on an Android phone.\
\
The scanner:\
1\. Requests camera permission.\
2\. Scans the student ID card QR code.\
3\. Retrieves student information from the database.\
4\. Displays student name.\
5\. Displays photograph.\
6\. Displays class and roll.\
7\. Records attendance automatically.\
8\. Shows the attendance time.\
9\. Prevents duplicate attendance.\
\
\### Voice Announcement\
\
After a successful scan, pronounce the student's name loudly using Bengali text-to-speech when supported.\
\
Example:\
\
"দেলোয়ার হোসেন, উপস্থিতি গ্রহণ করা হয়েছে।"\
\
Display a clear green confirmation message.\
\
If the student is already marked present, show a warning instead of creating duplicate attendance.\
\
\### Automatic Absent Detection\
\
Admin can configure:\
\- School starting time.\
\- Attendance closing time.\
\- SMS sending time.\
\
Default SMS time: 9:20 AM.\
\
At 9:20 AM:\
1\. Identify all students without a valid attendance record.\
2\. Mark them absent according to school attendance rules.\
3\. Generate an absent list.\
4\. Send Bangla SMS to their guardians.\
5\. Record SMS delivery status.\
\
The attendance cutoff must be configurable.\
\
\### SMS System\
\
Use a reliable SMS integration.\
\
Preferred option:\
\- Android phone with a SIM card and an authorized Android SMS bridge.\
\
Alternative:\
\- Compatible GSM modem or SMS gateway API.\
\
Phone number: 01308177171.\
\
Important technical requirement:\
\
A normal website running in a browser cannot silently send SMS through an Android SIM card. Therefore, build a separate Android SMS bridge or use an authorized SMS gateway. The bridge must receive authenticated SMS jobs from the backend.\
\
Provide message templates such as:\
\
"সম্মানিত অভিভাবক, আপনার সন্তান [Student Name] আজ [Date] তারিখে বিদ্যালয়ে উপস্থিত হয়নি। অনুগ্রহ করে বিদ্যালয়ের সাথে যোগাযোগ করুন। — Genius Zone Model School"\
